================================================================
  pk's OS - apna khud ka chhota Linux OS
  help      : pk-help
  system    : pk-info
  install   : pk-install            (disk pe permanent install)
  network   : pk-net dhcp
  apps      : pk-run ./app  |  pk-shell  |  pk-get install -y <pkg>   (pk-runtime status)
  users/device: pk-user list | pk-user add bob --admin | pk-seatd status | pk-check --users
  persistence: pk-persist           (USB pe changes save karne ke liye)
  Live session me sab changes RAM me hain; reboot pe reset.
